{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-rev-1-intro","title":"Revelation 1 — Chapter Introduction","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":0,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":0},"content":"<p>face to face. Gr. mouth to mouth. Peace. Ge 43:23; Da 4:1; Ga 5:16; Eph 6:23; 1Pe 5:14 Our. Ro 16:10,11; *marg: friends.Instead of [philoi] and [philous,] friends, an appellation used no where else as a mutual address among Christians, several MSS. read [adelphos and [adelphotes ,] brethren.</p>\n<p>Greet. Ro 16:1-16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-1-1","title":"Revelation 1:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The preface. 4 John's salutation to the seven churches of Asia. 7 The coming of Christ. 8 His glorious power and majesty.</p>\n<p>Revelation. Da 2:28,29; Am 3:7; Ro 16:25; Ga 1:12; Eph 3:3 which God. Joh 3:32; 8:26; 12:49 to shew. 22:6; Ps 25:14; Joh 15:15 which must. 3,19; 4:1; 22:10, 2Pe 3:8 and he. 22:6,16; Da 8:16; 9:21,23 John. 4,9; 21:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-1-2","title":"Revelation 1:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>bare. 9; 6:9; 12:11,17; Joh 1:32; 12:17; 19:35; 21:24; 1Co 1:6; 2:1 1Jo 5:7-11; 3Jo 1:12 and of all. 19; Joh 3:11; Ac 4:20; 22:15; 26:16; 1Jo 1:1; 4:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-1-3","title":"Revelation 1:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Blessed. 22:7; Pr 8:34; Da 12:12,13; Lu 11:28 for. 22:6,10,12,20; Ro 13:11; Jas 5:8,9; 1Pe 4:7; 2Pe 3:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-1-4","title":"Revelation 1:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>John. 1 to the. 11,20; 2:1,8,12,18; 3:1,7,14; Ac 19:10; 1Pe 1:1 Grace. Ro 1:7; 1Co 1:3; 2Co 1:2; 1Pe 1:2 him. 1:8; Ex 3:14; Ps 90:2; 102:25-27; Isa 41:4; 57:15; Mic 5:2; Joh 1:1 Heb 1:10-13; 13:8; Jas 1:17 from the. 3:1; 4:5; 5:6; Zec 3:9; 4:10; 6:5; 1Co 12:4-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-1-5","title":"Revelation 1:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>who is. 3:14; Ps 89:36,37; Isa 55:4; Joh 3:11,32; 8:14-16; 18:37; 1Ti 6:13 1Jo 5:7-10 and the first. Ac 26:23; 1Co 15:20-23; Col 1:18 and the prince. 11:15; 17:14; 19:16; Ps 72:11; 89:27; Pr 8:15,16; Da 2:2; 7:14 Mt 28:18; Eph 1:20-22; 1Ti 6:15 him. De 7:8; 23:5; Joh 13:1,34; 15:9; Ro 8:37; Ga 2:20; Eph 2:4; 5:2,25-27 1Jo 4:10 washed. 7:14; Zec 13:1; Joh 13:8-10; Ac 20:28; 1Co 6:11; Heb 9:14; 1Pe 1:19 1Jo 1:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-1-6","title":"Revelation 1:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>made. 5:10; 20:6; Ex 19:6; Isa 61:6; Ro 12:1; 1Pe 2:5-9 to him. 4:11; 5:12-14; Ps 72:18,19; Da 4:34; Mt 6:13; Joh 5:23; Php 2:11 1Ti 6:16; Heb 13:21; 1Pe 4:11; 5:11; 2Pe 3:18; Jude 1:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-1-7","title":"Revelation 1:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>he cometh. 14:14-16; Ps 97:2; Isa 19:1; Da 7:13; Na 1:3; Mt 24:30; 26:64 Mr 13:26; 14:62; Lu 21:27; Ac 1:9-11; 1Th 4:17 and every. 22:4; Nu 24:17; Job 19:26,27; 33:26; 1Th 1:10; 1Jo 3:2; Jude 1:14 and they. Ps 22:16; Zec 12:10; Joh 19:34,37; Heb 6:6; 10:29 and all. 6:15-17; 18:15-19; Mt 24:30; Lu 23:28-30 Even So. 18:20; 19:1-3; 22:20; Jud 5:31; Ps 68:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-1-8","title":"Revelation 1:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Alpha. 11,17; 2:8; 21:6; 22:13; Isa 41:4; 43:10; 44:6; 48:12 which is. 4 the Almighty. 4:8; 11:17; 16:14; 19:15; 21:22; Ge 17:1; 28:3; 35:11; 43:14; 48:3 Ge 49:25; Ex 6:3; Nu 24:4; Isa 9:6; 2Co 6:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-1-9","title":"Revelation 1:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>John. 4 companion. 2:9,10; 7:14; Joh 16:33; Ac 14:22; Ro 8:17; 1Co 4:9-13; Php 1:7; 4:14 2Ti 1:8; 2:3-12 in the. 3:10; 13:10; 14:12; Ro 2:7,8; 5:3,4; 8:25; 2Th 1:4,5; 3:5; Heb 10:36 Jas 5:7,8 for the word. 2; 6:9; 11:7; 12:11,17; 19:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-1-10","title":"Revelation 1:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>in. 4:2; 17:3; 21:10; Mt 22:43; Ac 10:10-33; 2Co 12:2-4 on the. Joh 20:19,26; Ac 20:7; 1Co 16:2 as. 4:1; 10:3-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-1-11","title":"Revelation 1:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>I am. 8,17 What. 19; 2:1; 10:4; 14:13; 19:9; 21:5; De 31:19; Isa 30:8; Jer 30:2; Hab 2:2 seven. 4; 2:1,8,12,18; 3:1,7,14 Ephesus. Ac 18:19-21,24; 19:1-41; 20:17; 1Co 15:32; 16:8; Eph 1:1; 1Ti 1:3 Laodicea. Col 4:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-1-12","title":"Revelation 1:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>see. Eze 43:5,6; Mic 6:9 I saw. 13,20; 2:1; Ex 25:37; Zec 4:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-1-13","title":"Revelation 1:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>like. 14:14; Eze 1:26-28; Da 7:9,13; 10:5,6,16; Php 2:7,8; Heb 2:14-17 Heb 4:15 clothed. Da 10:5 and girt. 15:6; Ex 28:6-8; 39:5; Le 8:7; Isa 11:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-1-14","title":"Revelation 1:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>and his hairs. Da 7:9; Mt 28:3 and his eyes. 2:18; 19:12; Da 10:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-1-15","title":"Revelation 1:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>his feet. 2:18; Eze 1:7; 40:3; Da 10:6 his voice. 14:2; 19:6; Ps 93:4; Isa 17:13; Eze 43:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-1-16","title":"Revelation 1:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>he had. 20; 2:1; 3:1; 12:1; Job 38:7; Da 8:10; 12:3 out. 2:12,16; 19:15,21; Isa 11:4; 49:2; Eph 6:17; Heb 4:12 and his. 10:1; Isa 24:23; 60:19,20; Mal 4:2; Ac 26:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-1-17","title":"Revelation 1:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>I fell. Eze 1:28; Da 8:18; 10:8,9,17-19; Hab 3:16; Mt 17:2-6; Joh 13:23 Joh 21:20 And he. Da 8:18; 10:10 Fear not. Ge 15:1; Ex 14:13; 20:20; Isa 41:10; Da 10:12; Mt 28:4; Mr 16:5,6 Lu 24:37-39 I am. 8,11; 2:8; 22:13; Isa 41:4; 44:6; 48:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-1-18","title":"Revelation 1:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>that liveth. Job 19:25; Ps 18:46; Joh 14:19; Ro 6:9; 2Co 13:4; Ga 2:20; Col 3:3 Heb 7:25 was. Ro 14:8,9; 2Co 5:14,15; Heb 1:3; 12:2 I am alive. 4:9; 5:14; Heb 7:16,25 the keys. 3:7; 9:1; 20:1,2,14; Ps 68:20; Isa 22:22; Mt 16:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-1-19","title":"Revelation 1:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>the things. 11,12-20 and the things which are. 2:1-3:22 and the things which shall be. 4:1-22:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-1-20","title":"Revelation 1:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>mystery. Mt 13:11; Lu 8:10 the seven stars. 13,16 the seven golden. 12 The seven stars. 2:1,8,12,18; 3:1,7,14; Mal 2:7 and the. Zec 4:2; Mt 5:15,16; Php 2:15,16; 1Ti 3:14-16</p>"}]}